OL,3,GNEWSATiktoker 'super excited' to
OL,4,Aco-host BBC nature show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's most followed TikTok creator
OL,7,Fsays he is "super excited" to be
OL,8,Fco-hosting the BBC's latest nature
OL,9,Fprogramme.
OL,11,FNaturewatch, hosted by wildlife
OL,12,Fpresenters Chris Packham, Megan
OL,13,FMcCubbin and influencer Kyle Thomas,
OL,14,Fstarts on Friday on BBC Two and will
OL,15,Frun all year round.
OL,17,FThe show, which is being produced by
OL,18,FBBC Studios' Natural History Unit, is
OL,19,Ffilmed in a secret location just south
OL,20,Fof Bristol city centre, and will
OL,21,Fcelebrate the best of British nature.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
