OL,3,GNEWSATiktoker 'super excited' to
OL,4,Aco-host BBC nature show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas, who has amassed more than 33
OL,7,Fmillion followers on TikTok for his
OL,8,Fvideos about animals, said Naturewatch
OL,9,Fwould act as a "trusted source of
OL,10,Freally brilliant factual information"
OL,11,Fas AI becomes increasingly common on
OL,12,Fsocial media.
